title: 'Introduce pallet-dap-satellite with fungible currency wrappers'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
      - Introduce pallet-dap-satellite for system chains (RC, BridgeHub, Coretime, People,
      Collectives) to collect funds that would otherwise be burned, staging them for periodic
      transfer to the central DAP on AssetHub.
      - Introduce DapCurrency and SatelliteCurrency fungible wrappers, intercepting `burn_from()`
      calls through the fungible traits so that imbalance is intercepted before being dropped, funds
      are deposited to DAP / DAP satellite  and total isssuance is unchanged.
      - Redirect all system burns to DAP or DAP satellite on Westend system chains, including
      tx fees, dust removal and coretime revenue burns.
crates:
- name: pallet-dap-satellite
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-dap
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-sdk
  bump: minor
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: major
- name: westend-runtime
  bump: minor
